tructure projects. This segment serves real-estate and building developers, and general contractors. It sells its products directly to customers, as well as through agents and distributors. The Service segment performs maintenance and repair services, as well as modernization services to upgrade elevators and escalators. Otis Worldwide Corporation was founded in 1853 and is headquartered in Farmington, Connecticut.","fullTimeEmployees":72000,"city":"Farmington","country":"United States","website":"https://www.otis.com","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","sector":"Industrials"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-23"}